     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "See branch fcrepo-990 for simple fix for this.  Really should be refactored and eg use fedora client.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Or longer term search for an alternative to this web service - it's not Fedora specific, maybe there is some other implementation of saxon as a web service that we could use rather than maintaining this one?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
