      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>See branch fcrepo-990 for simple fix for this.  Really should be refactored and eg use fedora client.</p>\n\n<p>Or longer term search for an alternative to this web service - it's not Fedora specific, maybe there is some other implementation of saxon as a web service that we could use rather than maintaining this one?</p>",
